Modified for TarisOS (https://github.com/TarisOS/tarisOS) since 2026:

- taris-volume.patch (src/services/pipewire/node.cpp): audio nodes that report more channel
  volumes than channels, such as Asahi Linux's microphone, have their volume and mute state read
  and set instead of ignored.

The changes are in TarisOS's source, packaging/pkgbuilds/quickshell-taris.
